 Tf-1.0476 -1.619 TD-0.016 Tw[(Y)62.5(our business logic tier)]TJ/F11 1 Tf11.3333 0 TD-0.0139 Tw[( runs within the address space of one or more )]TJ/F13 1 Tf20.2857 0 TD(appli-)Tj-30.5714 -1.2381 TD0.0181 Tw(cation servers)Tj/F11 1 Tf6.381 0 TD0.0163 Tw(. Application servers are necessary to provide a suitable con-)Tj-6.381 -1.2381 TD0.0232 Tc0.0626 Tw[(tainment environment for the business logic components to run in. The)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0287 Tw(application server also manages these components efficiently and provides)TjT*0.0034 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(a number of services to the components. For example, the application server)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0031 Tw(provides a database access layer for the business components, allowing the)TjT*-0.0173 Tw[(business components to persist data to and load data from the data tier)-14.5(. The)]TJT*0.0533 Tw(application server is also responsible for making the business components)TjT*0.004 Tc0 Tw(available to be used, instantiating them as necessary.)Tj/F22 1 Tf-1.0476 -1.619 TD0.0018 Tc-0.0573 Tw[(Y)60.4(our data tier)]TJ/F11 1 Tf6.6667 0 TD0.0021 Tc-0.05 Tw[( consists of one or more databases and may contain data-related)]TJ-5.619 -1.2381 TD0.0039 Tc0 Tw(logic in the form of stored procedures.)Tj-1.0476 -1.9048 TD-0.0161 Tc-0.0282 Tw[(Note that a single-company W)17.2(eb deployment is only one example of a viable N-tier)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD-0.0052 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(deployment. Another example is a banking system that has many tiers, with each)]TJT*-0.0161 Tc-0.0362 Tw[(tier representing a department of a bank. Another example is a control system that)]TJT*[(does not have a graphical user interface, yet also requires several tiers. Y)66.9(et another)]TJT*0.007 Tc0.0625 Tw[(example is a distributed deployment that spans company boundaries, where)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0445 Tw(several companies work together to provide enhanced value \(such as an online)TjT*-0.0237 Tc-0.05 Tw[(pur