ts surfaced. Since then, multitudes of application servers have begun to)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0475 Tw[(appear on the market. These application servers provide a usable runtime envi-)]TJT*0 Tc-0.05 Tw[(ronment in which components can execute and provide the needed middleware)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0235 Tw[(services \(such as resource pooling and security\) for reliability and scalability)14.6(.)]TJT*-0.0011 Tc-0.05 Tw[(But unfortunately)64.1(, up until now there has not been a definition of what a middle-)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0303 Tw[(tier component really is. Because of this, each application server has been pro-)]TJT*-0.0051 Tw[(viding)-70.4( component services in a non-uniform, proprietary way)82(. This means that)]TJT*0.0581 Tw[(once )-36.6(you bet on an application server)66.4(, your code is locked into that vendor\325)16.2(s)]TJT*-0.0428 Tw[(solution.)-62.5( This greatly reduces portability and is an especially tough pill to swal-)]TJT*-0.0063 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(low in the Java world, which promotes portability)22.8(.)-0.1( It also hampers the commerce)]TJT*-0.0035 Tc[(of com)-90.5(ponents because a customer cannot combine a component written to one)]TJT*0.0047 Tc0.0626 Tw[(applicati)-83.2(on server with another component written to a different application)]TJT*0.0043 Tc[(server)-14.3(.)]TJ0 -1.8095 TD0.0039 Tc-0.0321 Tw[(From this, the need for a standard architecture for server)27.7(-side components has)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD-0.0061 Tc0.0239 Tw[(arisen. This architecture needs to craft a well-formed interface between the ap-)]TJT*-0.0156 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(plication server)31.6(, which contains the components, and the components themselves)-36.2(.)]TJT*0.0034 Tc-0.05 Tw[(These interfaces allow the components to be managed in a portable way)-19.8(, rather)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0184 Tw[(than a proprietary one. The component vendors should be able to focus )-86(on the)]TJT*-0.0391 Tw[(business logic of the problems being solved and n