3 Tc0.0626 Tw[(server. Client-side Java has many problems, such as inconsistency with user)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0268 Tw[(interfaces between platforms, slow speed of these user interfaces, and wrong)]TJT*-0.0002 Tc-0.05 Tw[(versions of Java V)-7.4(irtual Machines running on client machines. But for the server)]TJT*0.0096 Tc0.0625 Tw(side, Java is the ideal language. Server-side deployments run in a controlled)TjT*0.0039 Tc0.0583 Tw[(environment, which means that the correct version of the Java programming)]TJT*0.008 Tw[(language will always be used. The speed of Java is also a less significant issue)]TJT*-0.0073 Tc-0.05 Tw[(on the server because often typically 80 percent or more of an N-tier application\325)-8.5(s)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0001 Tw(time is spent at the database or networking level.)Tj0 -1.9048 TD0.0376 Tw[(Java is also a very convenient language to write server)-35.3(-side components in, if)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD0.0197 Tw[(for one reason alone: The server)52(-side market is dominated by UNIX machines)]TJT*0.0112 Tw[(and mainframes. This means a cross-platform language for writing server)-16.2(-side)]TJT*-0.0384 Tw(components adds huge value because a developer can write a component once)TjT*0.0237 Tw[(and deploy it on any customer\325)36.4(s existing server)-13.3(-side environment. This means)]TJT*0.0275 Tw(that customers with legacy applications \(such as programs written in COBOL)TjT*-0.0225 Tw(on mainframe systems\) have a well-defined migration path to e-commerce and)TjT*0.0004 Tw(other modern business processes.)Tj0 -1.8095 TD0.0046 Tc0.0626 Tw[(Thus, to enable server)53(-side computing in Java, Sun has produced a complete)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD0.0039 Tc-0.036 Tw[(development platform called the )]TJ/F13 1 Tf14.4762 0 TD-0.04 Tw(Java 2 Platform, Enterprise Edition)Tj/F11 1 Tf16.1905 0 TD-0.0321 Tc0 Tw( \()Tj/F13 1 Tf0.6667 0 TD0.0039 Tc(J2EE)Tj/F11 1 Tf2.381 0 TD(\).)Tj-33.7143 -1.2381 TD-0.0216 Tw[(The mission of J2EE is to provide a platform-independent, portable, multiuser,)]TJT*0.017 Tc0.0624 Tw[(secure, and standard enterprise-class platform for server-side deployments)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0267 Tw[(written in the Java language. The cornerstone of J2EE is Enterprise JavaBeans)]TJT*0.0002 Tw(\(EJB\), a standard for building server-side components in Java.)Tj0 -1.9048 TD0.0097 Tc0.0626 Tw[(J2EE simplifies many of the complexities surrounding the construction of a)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD0.0039 Tc0.0128 Tw[(scalable, component-based server)6.3(-side application, and it is very analogous to)]TJT*0.0171 Tc0.0625 Tw[(W)-46.3(indows DNA. The most notable exception is that J2EE is a specification,)]TJETendstreamendobj179 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F7 8 0 R/F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F17 29 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj181 0 obj<</Length 5221>>stream
