rvice.)]TJ0 -1.9048 TD0.0039 Tc-0.0085 Tw[(The Java Naming and Directory Interface \(JNDI\) solves this problem by bridg-)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD-0.0221 Tw[(ing the gap between different directory services. W)-16.1(ith JNDI, you can write por)20.3(-)]TJT*-0.016 Tw[(table naming and directory service code, rather than writing nonportable code)]TJT*-0.0308 Tw[(that works only with a particular directory service or standard. Y)70.1(ou can do this)]TJT*-0.0081 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(because JNDI abstracts your code from any particular directory service, enabling)]TJETendstreamendobj204 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F7 8 0 R/F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F15 22 0 R/F17 29 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj206 0 obj<</Length 5303>>stream
