ployment. T)7.1(o)0( achieve this, the components)]TJT*[(need a variety of tricky middleware, such as connection pooling, security)-9.9(,)]TJT*-0.0061 Tc0 Tw(and life-cycle management. Rather than explicitly writing these middleware)TjT*0.0039 Tc0.0003 Tw(services over and over again, EJB enables middleware vendors to provide)TjT*0.0002 Tw[(these system-level services in an application server)7.4(. How do the compo-)]TJT*0 Tw[(nents leverage these middleware services? In traditional server)6.3(-side pro-)]TJT*0.0003 Tw(gramming, you as a component developer would need to explicitly write)TjT*-0.0061 Tc-0.0002 Tw(to middleware APIs, such as persistence APIs, security APIs, or transaction)TjT*0.0039 Tc-0.0001 Tw[(APIs. In the EJB world, however)31.6(, things are much easier)74.3(. An application)]TJT*-0.0061 Tc0.0005 Tw(server provides middleware services for you in a )Tj/F13 1 Tf21.2381 0 TD(transparent)Tj/F11 1 Tf5.2381 0 TD0.0004 Tw[( way)99.4(, without)]TJ-26.4762 -1.2381 TD-0.0002 Tw(your explicitly coding to middleware APIs. This is possible because the EJB)TjT*0.0001 Tw(specification lays out the rules governing middleware that both components)TjT*0.0039 Tc-0.0001 Tw[(and application servers must follow)36.3(. For example, your components can)]TJT*0.0001 Tw(get automatic persistence by setting )Tj/F13 1 Tf16.1905 0 TD(attributes)Tj/F11 1 Tf4.381 0 TD( on your component that)Tj-20.5714 -1.2381 TD0.0002 Tw[(describe the component\325)13.1(s need for persistence. The application server)]TJT*-0.0001 Tw(understands these attributes because the EJB specification defines them,)TjT*0.0001 Tw(and the application server complies with the specification. As a compo-)TjT*-0.0001 Tw[(nent developer)13.2(, this means your life is simplified greatly because you can)]TJT*(rapidly develop persistent components without coding to, debugging, or)TjT*0.0002 Tw[(even understanding persistence APIs. T)-27.1(ransparent middleware is a signifi-)]TJT*0.0001 Tw(cant achievement because it allows developers to concentrate on applica-)TjT*0.0002 Tw(tion logic, rather than system-level middleware issues.)Tj-1.0476 -1.619 TD[(3.)-291.4(W)35.8(ith application servers and reusable components for sale in a market-)]TJ1.0476 -1.2381 TD-0.0061 Tc0 Tw(place, a customer can purchase these and combine them to solve a business)TjETendstreamendobj232 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F7 8 0 R/F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F17 29 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj234 0 obj<</Length 5147>>stream
