[(As we\325ve mentioned, the bean provider supplies reusable, deployable server)16.4(-side)]TJT*0.0015 Tc-0.05 Tw(components. But when these components are purchased by a customer and put)TjT*0.0039 Tc0.0342 Tw[(to actual use, who actually assembles them to solve a business problem? The)]TJT*-0.0135 Tw(answer is the )Tj/F13 1 Tf6.0952 0 TD-0.015 Tw(application assembler)Tj/F11 1 Tf10 0 TD0 Tc0 Tw(.)Tj-16.0952 -1.9048 TD0.0039 Tc-0.0275 Tw[(The application assembler is the person, whether on staff or as an outside con-)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD-0.0043 Tc-0.05 Tw[(sultant, who understands the complete application system and understands how)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0476 Tw[(the various components fit together)35.5(. He or she is the application architect\321the)]TJT*-0.0151 Tw[(person who understands what the components do. His or her job is to build an)]TJT*0.0103 Tw[(application from those components\321an application that can be deployed in a)]TJT*-0.0006 Tw(number of settings.)Tj0 -1.8095 TD0.0001 Tw(The application assembler could perform any or all of the following tasks:)Tj0.381 -1.9048 TD0.0002 Tw[(1.)-291.4(W)35.8(rite the code that calls on components purchased from vendors.)]TJ0 -1.619 TD[(2.)-291.4(Provide a workflow solution between a number of disparate components,)]TJ1.0476 -1.2381 TD(mapping between them.)Tj-1.0476 -1.619 TD0.0003 Tw[(3.)-291.4(Supply a user interface \(perhaps using JFC, JSP)70.2(, or servlets\).)]TJT*0.0001 Tw[(4.)-291.4(W)35.8(rite new enterprise beans to solve domain-specific problems. For exam-)]TJ1.0476 -1.2381 TD(ple, you might need to model a business process or business entity that is)TjT*-0.0001 Tw(specific to your business. This task will often fall into the hands of the)TjT*[(application assembler)48(.)]TJ-1.4286 -1.8095 TD-0.0357 Tw(Note that EJB allows for distributed components \(versus the traditionally rigid)Tj0 -1.2381 TD-0.0006 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(client/server paradigm\). Therefore, the application assembler could be involved)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.048 Tw(in the design and implementation of logic residing in several tiers in a multi-tier)TjT*0.0029 Tw(architecture. Perhaps the code the application assembler writes is local to the)TjETendstreamendobj254 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F7 8 0 R/F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F17 29 0 R/F22 81 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj256 0 obj<</Length 4247>>stream
