Tc-0.05 Tw[(which the beans are to be deployed. He or she also has knowledge of a customer\325)-9.4(s)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0102 Tw(existing naming and directory services and understands how to customize en-)TjT*0 Tw(terprise beans for that scenario.)Tj0 -1.8095 TD0.0083 Tw(Another concrete role of the deployer is mapping security settings. Most busi-)Tj0 -1.2381 TD-0.0301 Tw(nesses store lists of their employees and their security levels in some directory)TjT*-0.0064 Tc-0.05 Tw[(service structure, and the EJB deployer may be required to adapt the access level)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0291 Tw[(of the beans to fit that particular environment. That way)-12.7(, the multi-tier applica-)]TJT*-0.0032 Tc-0.05 Tw[(tion developed by the application assembler is usable in the specific deployment)]TJT*0.004 Tc(scenario.)Tj0 -1.9048 TD0.0039 Tc0.0302 Tw[(T)43.5(o)0( facilitate this process, EJB deployers must be aware of the differences be-)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD-0.0069 Tc-0.05 Tw(tween the various beans, servers, and containers on the market. An EJB deployer)TjT*0.0039 Tc0.0003 Tw(can be a staff person or an outside consultant.)Tj/F7 1 Tf13.5 0 0 13.5 67 184 Tm0.0001 Tc0.0007 Tw[(The Syst)21.4(em Administrator)]TJ/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 103 163 Tm0.001 Tc-0.05 Tw[(Once the deployment goes live, the system administrator steps in to oversee the)]TJT*-0.0003 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(stability of the operational solution. The system administrator is responsible for)]TJT*-0.005 Tc-0.05 Tw[(the upkeep and monitoring of the deployed system and may make use of runtime)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0149 Tw(monitoring and management tools that the EJB server and containers provide.)Tj0 -1.8095 TD-0.0204 Tw[(For example, a sophisticated deployment might page a system administrator if)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD-0.0423 Tw[(a serious error occurs that requires immediate attention. Note that EJB servers)]TJT*-0.0023 Tw(and containers may not provide this explicit monitoring \(and it is not required)TjT*-0.0152 Tw[(by the EJB specification\). Some EJB products, however)-9.9(, are developing hooks)]TJT*0.0002 Tc-0.05 Tw[(into professional monitoring products, such as T)-43.1(ivoli and Computer Associates,)]TJETendstreamendobj257 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F7 8 0 R/F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F17 29 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj259 0 obj<</Length 4260>>stream
