eans represent business processes. Some business)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD-0.0265 Tw(processes can be performed in a single method request, such as computing the)TjT*-0.0229 Tw[(price of goods or verifying a credit card account. Other business processes are)]TJT*0.0022 Tc-0.05 Tw(more drawn out and can last across multiple method requests and transactions.)Tj0 -1.8095 TD0.0059 Tc0.0626 Tw[(One example of a business process that lasts for multiple method calls is an)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD0.0039 Tc-0.0378 Tw[(e-commerce W)-34.4(eb store. As the user peruses an online e-commerce W)48.5(eb site, he)]TJT*0.0055 Tc0.0625 Tw(or she can add products to the online shopping cart. This implies a business)TjT*0.0039 Tc-0.0111 Tw[(process that spans multiple method requests. The consequence of such a busi-)]TJT*0.0026 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(ness process is that the components must track the user\325)-28.7(s state \(such as a shop-)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0001 Tw(ping cart state\) from request to request.)Tj0 -1.9048 TD0.0137 Tw[(Another example of a drawn-out business process is a banking application. In)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD-0.0238 Tw[(a bank, you may have code representing a bank teller that deals with a particu-)]TJT*[(lar client for a long amount of time. That teller may perform a number of bank-)]TJT*-0.0303 Tw[(ing transactions on behalf of that client, such as checking the account balance,)]TJT*0.0005 Tw(depositing funds, and making a withdrawal.)Tj0 -1.8095 TD(A )Tj/F13 1 Tf0.9524 0 TD-0.0117 Tw(stateful session bean)Tj/F11 1 Tf9.3333 0 TD-0.0105 Tw[( is a bean that\325)12.8(s designed to service business processes)]TJ-10.2857 -1.2381 TD0.001 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(that span multiple method requests or transactions. T)-8.1(o)0( accomplish this, stateful)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0345 Tw(session beans )Tj/F13 1 Tf6.2857 0 TD-0.0383 Tw(retain state)Tj/F11 1 Tf5.2381 0 TD-0.0345 Tw[( on behalf of an individual client. If a stateful session)]TJ-11.5238 -1.2381 TD-0.0022 Tc-0.05 Tw[(bean\325)37.1(s state is changed during a method invocation, that same state will be avail-)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0 Tw(able to that same client upon the following invocation.)Tj/F17 1 Tf9.5 0 0 9.5 103 108 Tm0.0237 Tc0.0004 Tw(Stateless Session Beans)Tj/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 103 92 Tm-0.006 Tc-0.05 Tw(Some business processes naturally lend themselves to a single request paradigm.)TjT*0.0039 Tc-0.0217 Tw(A single request business process is one that does not require state to be main-)TjT*0.0016 Tc-0.05 Tw(tained across method invocations. Stateless session beans are components that)TjT*0.0039 Tc0.0527 Tw[(can accommodate these types of single request business processes. They are)]TJETendstreamendobj263 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F17 29 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj265 0 obj<</Length 6783>>stream
