89 Tw[(specify remote accessibility)52.6(, which you can learn about by reading Appendix)]TJT*0.0242 Tw[(A. The benefit of distributed communication technologies such as RMI is that)]TJT*-0.0303 Tw(your client code is unaware of the physical location of the component it is call-)TjT*-0.038 Tw[(ing. The component could be located across the world, on a local area network)]TJETendstreamendobj300 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F7 8 0 R/F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F17 29 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj302 0 obj<</Length 4609>>stream
