errors will improve as EJB container technology matures)TjT*0.0099 Tc0.0626 Tw[(over the years. Until the EJB market matures, not all vendors will prioritize)]TJT*0.0004 Tc-0.05 Tw(implementing complex mapping of data types to underlying storages, or correct)TjT*0.0039 Tc0.0137 Tw[(relationship handling. Be sure to evaluate your container here to ensure it fits)]TJT*0 Tw(your application requirements.)Tj/F7 1 Tf13.5 0 0 13.5 76 312 Tm0.0002 Tc[(Promise: Container-Managed P)-7.1(e)0(rsist)23.3(ence Makes It Easy to)]TJ0 -1.1111 TD0.0001 Tc-0.0001 Tw[(P)11.5(o)-0.1(r)-57.8(t)0( to Different Databases)]TJ/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 112 277 Tm0.0091 Tc0.0625 Tw[(One nice thing about container)26.1(-managed persistence is that you aren\325)19.9(t)0( hard-)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD-0.0065 Tc-0.05 Tw[(coding a particular database storage API into your beans, such as JDBC. Because)]TJT*-0.0025 Tc[(you aren\325)-43.8(t)0( issuing explicit relational database calls in your persistence layer)64.6(, you)]TJT*-0.0035 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(can easily move into a different database, such as a different relational database,)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0002 Tw(or even an object database or legacy storage.)Tj0 -1.9048 TD-0.006 Tc0.004 Tw(Database independence is very important. EJB defines a market for beans to be)Tj0 -1.2381 TD0.0039 Tc0.0346 Tw[(purchased off-the-shelf, and those beans must be able to work with whatever)]TJT*0.0122 Tw[(target database the customer has. Given that enterprise beans represent intel-)]TJT*-0.0071 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(lectual property)49(,)-0.1( they will most likely not ship with their source code. This means)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0471 Tw[(that if an entity bean uses bean-managed persistence, the customer cannot eas-)]TJT*0.0372 Tw[(ily tweak the data access logic. For these vendors, container)25.2(-managed persis-)]TJT*-0.0036 Tc-0.05 Tw(tence is the only alternative to shipping multiple versions of the same bean code.)Tj/F15 1 Tf11.5 0 0 11.5 112 96 Tm0.0115 Tc(Reality)Tj/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 112 75 Tm0.011 Tc0.0626 Tw[(Although it is true that container)-12.1(-managed persistence improves portability)82.3(,)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0001 Tw(portability is not perfect yet. For instance:)TjETendstreamendobj905 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F7 8 0 R/F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F15 22 0 R/F17 29 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj908 0 obj<</Length 4216>>stream
