9 Tw[(o)10(p)-33.1(ment. CORBA, on the other hand, offers a much broader suite of middleware)]TJT*-0.0394 Tw[(features with which to work. This includes a time service, a distributed locking)]TJT*-0.0423 Tw[(service, a relationship service, and more. T)43.7(o)0( use CORBA)94.6(\325)35.4(s)0( services, you need to)]TJT*0.0041 Tc0.0625 Tw[(program to complex middleware APIs, which increase the learning curve for)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0448 Tw[(CORBA programming. This is why EJB and J2EE are much more suitable for)]TJT*0.007 Tw[(rapid application development than CORBA. And because EJB is officially be-)]TJT*0.0321 Tw(ing supported by the industry \(there are 25+ vendors writing EJB products at)TjT*0.0106 Tw[(this time\), EJB will give you a much wider variety of tools to work with in the)]TJT*0.0015 Tw(long run.)Tj0 -1.9048 TD0.0522 Tw[(Regardless of this, CORBA is a very important technology and is quite useful)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD-0.0224 Tw[(for advanced middleware development, cross-language support, and legacy in-)]TJT*-0.0049 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(tegration. In fact, most serious EJB products on the market are based on CORBA)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0002 Tw(and use CORBA concepts behind the scenes.)TjET0.8 0.8 0.8 RG24 w 10 M /GS1 gs67 256 m97 256 lS0 0 0 RG1 w 67 244.5 m464 244.5 lSBT/F7 1 Tf15 0 0 15 73 250 Tm/GS2 gs-0.0002 Tc0.0001 Tw[(Why Should I Care about C)-19.1(O)-0.2(R)-25.2(B)45.8(A?)]TJ/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 103 221 Tm0.0039 Tc-0.0415 Tw[(T)43.5(o)0( you, as an EJB application assembler or bean provider)22.3(, CORBA is important)]TJT*0.0002 Tw(for three reasons:)Tj/F22 1 Tf0 -1.8095 TD-0.0103 Tw[(Y)62.5(ou can use CORBA for legacy integration.)]TJ/F11 1 Tf21.3333 0 TD-0.009 Tw(If you have an existing invest-)Tj-20.2857 -1.2381 TD-0.0003 Tc-0.05 Tw(ment \(such as a legacy banking application\) you can leverage that investment)TjT*0.0039 Tc0.0486 Tw[(today using CORBA. For example, let\325)-37.9(s say you have a banking application)]TJT*0.0033 Tc-0.05 Tw[(written in C++. CORBA gives you the ability to preserve and reuse it. Y)46(ou can)]TJT*-0.0088 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(wrap your existing investment as a CORBA object, allowing it to be called from)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0387 Tw[(any application. As we\325ll find out, CORBA is a language-neutral standard and)]TJT*0.0031 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(allows code written in several languages to communicate. Thus CORBA is an)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0 Tw(ideal platform for code written in different languages to cooperate.)Tj/F22 1 Tf-1.0476 -1.619 TD-0.013 Tc-0.0574 Tw[(CORBA allows for advanced middleware development.)]TJ/F11 1 Tf25.8095 0 TD-0.0121 Tc-0.05 Tw(Remember that EJB)Tj-24.7619 -1.2381 TD-0.001 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(is not supposed to be an end-all to every problem. But if there is a middleware)]TJT*0.0189 Tc0.0626 Tw(service that can be generalized, you\325re likely to find it standardized as a)TjT*0.0038 Tc0 Tw(CORBA service. For those who need it, CORBA gives great functionality.)TjETendstreamendobj1057 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F7 8 0 R/F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F17 29 0 R/F22 81 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj1059 0 obj<</Length 4632>>stream
