quests formatted)Tj0 -1.2381 TD[(with IIOP)99.3(. The ORB receives the request and calls a special RMI skeleton)]TJT*-0.0001 Tw(that knows how to accept the call from an ORB. \(Notice that our RMI)TjT*0 Tw[(skeletons are receiving the request via IIOP)127.2(, rather than the traditional)]TJT*-0.0012 Tw(JRMP protocol.\))TjETendstreamendobj1108 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F17 29 0 R/F20 77 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj1110 0 obj<</Length 4459>>stream
