orm, cross-language architecture.)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0413 Tw[(CORBA also provides a full suite of enterprise features, such as transactions,)]TJT*-0.0148 Tw[(security)7.5(, and persistence. The Internet Inter)91.9(-Orb Protocol \(IIOP\), a robust pro-)]TJT*0.0234 Tc0.0625 Tw[(tocol for distributed object communications, is used behind the scenes in)]TJT*0.0043 Tc(CORBA.)Tj0 -1.9048 TD0.0028 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(Note that both these trade-offs are historical. The differences between RMI and)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD0.0039 Tc-0.028 Tw(CORBA are beginning to disappear because both RMI and CORBA are learning)TjT*0.034 Tw[(from each other)-15.4(. Many of the services specific to CORBA are becoming avail-)]TJT*0.0099 Tw[(able with RMI coupled with the Java 2 Platform, Enterprise Edition. Similarly)15.3(,)]TJ/F7 1 Tf24 0 0 24 76 539 Tm/GS1 gs0 Tc-0.0004 Tw[(Understanding Java Remot)18.9(e)]TJ0 -1.1667 TD[(Method Invocation \(R)-42.6(MI\))]TJETendstreamendobj1698 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F7 8 0 R/F11 10 0 R/F17 29 0 R/F19 73 0 R/F26 101 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj1700 0 obj<</Length 4919>>stream
