re, at some point, you\325ll need to deal with Remote Exceptions being thrown)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0079 Tw[(due to networking issues. Some may consider this a limitation of RMI because)]TJT*0.0186 Tw(the network is not entirely \322seamless,\323 because Remote Exceptions force you)TjT*-0.0411 Tw[(to differentiate a local method from a remote method. But in some ways, this is)]TJT*0.0067 Tc0.0625 Tw[(an advantage of RMI as well. Interlacing your code with Remote Exceptions)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.05 Tw(forces you to think about the network and encourages distributed object devel-)TjT*-0.005 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(opers to consider issues such as the network failing, the size of parameters going)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0002 Tw(across the network, and more.)Tj/F7 1 Tf13.5 0 0 13.5 76 268 Tm0.0002 Tc0.0004 Tw[(R)-41.5(M)-45.8(I\325s Remot)6.5(e Exception limitations)]TJ/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 112 248 Tm0.0063 Tc0.0626 Tw[(As we\325ve said, Remote Exceptions are useful for detecting nasty networking)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0316 Tw[(issues, such as application death, machine crashes, and network failures. But)]TJT*0.0144 Tw(how robust are Remote Exceptions for detecting problems in enterprise-class)TjT*0.004 Tc(deployments?)Tj0 -1.9048 TD0.0039 Tc-0.0183 Tw[(Let\325)7.6(s investigate this matter by using RMI as a communications mechanism for)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD0.0109 Tw[(performing banking operations. Banking operations are a perfect example be-)]TJT*0.0188 Tw[(cause they are mission-critical. Any errors in a bank statement could result in)]TJT*0.0001 Tw(millions in lost funds.)Tj0 -1.8095 TD-0.0337 Tw[(W)35.8(e)0(\325ll implement a bank operator as a distributed object based on the RMI stan-)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD0.022 Tw[(dard. One of the methods our banking operator exposes is withdraw\(\), which)]TJT*0.0003 Tw(is used for withdrawing money. Seems simple enough, right?)Tj0 -1.9048 TD0.0062 Tc0.0626 Tw[(W)38.1(r)-0.1(ong. There is a serious danger in doing this. Let\325)-15.1(s)0( say you call withdraw\(\))]TJ0 -1.2381 TD0.0039 Tc0.0001 Tw[(remotely)15.5(, but the network dies at some point:)]TJETendstreamendobj1775 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F7 8 0 R/F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F17 29 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj1777 0 obj<</Length 6761>>stream
