c-0.0499 Tw[(When you combine RMI with some of the other Java APIs, the benefits of CORBA)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD0.0039 Tc0.042 Tw[(begin to dwindle. For example, the Java Naming and Directory Interface pro-)]TJT*0.0135 Tc0.0626 Tw[(vides naming and directory services, which are related to CORBA)70.1(\325)45(s)0( Naming)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0317 Tw[(Service. The Java T)43.3(ransaction API and Java T)27.7(ransaction Service can be used to)]TJT*-0.0262 Tw[(perform robust transactions, which are related to CORBA)59.8(\325)35.4(s)0( Object T)49.8(ransaction)]TJT*0.004 Tc0.0226 Tw[(Service. Security, MOM support, persistence, and more are all provided in the)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0135 Tw[(Java 2 Platform, Enterprise Edition. Y)23.6(ou can even achieve some semblance of)]TJT*0.0572 Tw[(cross-language interoperability by combining RMI with the Java Native Inter)-32.1(-)]TJT*0.0024 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(face \(JNI\), called RMI/JNI. Y)28(ou can also perform relational database operations)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0029 Tw(over the network by combining Java Database Connectivity \(JDBC\) with RMI,)TjT*-0.0006 Tw(called RMI/JDBC.)Tj0 -1.8095 TD0.0164 Tw[(CORBA, on the other hand, is becoming easier and easier to use. CORBA pro-)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD0.0414 Tw(vides a breadth of functionality, which in the past has been very tough to use)TjT*-0.0063 Tw[(because you had to learn a separate Interface Definition Language \(IDL\). Now)]TJT*0.0132 Tw[(there are automatic tools that will generate IDL for you. Sun\325)-6.7(s )]TJ/F13 1 Tf27.5238 0 TD0.0147 Tw(Java IDL)Tj/F11 1 Tf4.1905 0 TD0.0132 Tw[( prod-)]TJ-31.7143 -1.2381 TD-0.0095 Tw[(uct, for example, can read a standard remote interface definition and generate)]TJT*0.004 Tc0.0042 Tw[(IDL automatically)67.3(. And with the new CORBA Components proposal, it may be)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.042 Tw[(possible to provide many of CORBA)92.8(\325)35.4(s)0( services automatically)50.5(, providing a rich)]TJT*-0.0005 Tw[(server)-16.5(-side component architecture for developers.)]TJ0 -1.9048 TD-0.0244 Tw[(For these reasons, Sun endorses both RMI and CORBA. There is no clear \322win-)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD-0.0184 Tw[(ner\323 in networking technology)75.1(. As both technologies mature, you\325ll start to see)]TJETendstreamendobj1858 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F7 8 0 R/F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F17 29 0 R/F24 92 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj1860 0 obj<</Length 6100>>stream
