directory)36.2(. Rather than rewriting all of your directory-based applications, JNDI)]TJT*0.0101 Tc0.0626 Tw[(allows your code to be portable between directory services. This minimizes)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.002 Tw(overhead headaches.)Tj/F7 1 Tf13.5 0 0 13.5 76 321 Tm0.0001 Tc-0.0006 Tw[(Benefits of J)-28.3(N)-11.6(DI)]TJ/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 112 301 Tm0.0039 Tc0.0003 Tw(The following surveys the advantages that JNDI has to offer:)Tj/F20 1 Tf6 0 0 6 112 282 Tm0 Tc0 Tw(n)Tj0.5 0 TD(n)Tj/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 127 281 Tm0.0039 Tc(JNDI is a unified system to access all sorts of directory service informa-)Tj0 -1.2381 TD(tion, such as security credentials, phone numbers, electronic and postal)TjT*-0.0001 Tw(mail addresses, application preferences, network addresses, machine con-)TjT*0.0002 Tw(figurations, and more.)Tj/F20 1 Tf6 0 0 6 112 226 Tm0 Tc0 Tw(n)Tj0.5 0 TD(n)Tj/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 127 225 Tm-0.0061 Tc[(JNDI is a single API to access different directories with different protocols)-34.3(.)]TJ/F20 1 Tf6 0 0 6 112 209 Tm0 Tc(n)Tj0.5 0 TD(n)Tj/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 127 208 Tm0.0039 Tc0.0001 Tw(JNDI insulates the application from protocol and implementation details.)Tj/F20 1 Tf6 0 0 6 112 192 Tm0 Tc0 Tw(n)Tj0.5 0 TD(n)Tj/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 127 191 Tm0.0039 Tc-0.0001 Tw(JNDI is extensible. Future providers of directories can plug in their par-)Tj0 -1.2381 TD0.0002 Tw(ticular directory services to JNDI without affecting your client code.)Tj/F20 1 Tf6 0 0 6 112 162 Tm0 Tc0 Tw(n)Tj0.5 0 TD(n)Tj/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 127 161 Tm0.0039 Tc0.0001 Tw(Using JNDI, you can read and write whole Java objects from directories.)Tj0 -1.2381 TD0.0002 Tw(This is a very powerful idea, which we\325ll illustrate in the discussion that)TjT*(follows.)Tj/F20 1 Tf6 0 0 6 112 119 Tm0 Tc0 Tw(n)Tj0.5 0 TD(n)Tj/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 127 118 Tm0.0039 Tc0.0002 Tw[(Y)43.5(ou can link different types of directories, such as an LDAP directory with)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD0.0001 Tw[(an NDS directory, and have the combination appear to be one large, feder)115.5(-)]TJT*(ated directory. The federated directory appears to be one contiguous di-)TjT*-0.0002 Tw(rectory to the client.)TjETendstreamendobj1886 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F7 8 0 R/F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F17 29 0 R/F20 77 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj1888 0 obj<</Length 6771>>stream
