been a ma-)]TJT*-0.0004 Tw(jor proponent of JNDI.)Tj/F15 1 Tf11.5 0 0 11.5 103 321 Tm0.0116 Tc(SLP)Tj/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 103 300 Tm0.0024 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(The Service Location Protocol \(SLP\) provides a scalable framework for the dis-)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.044 Tw(covery and selection of network services, minimizing the need for static con-)TjT*0.0235 Tc0.0626 Tw[(figuration within network-based applications. SLP is an Internet Standard)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0056 Tw[(protocol that can be used for a variety of purposes, such as discovering DHCP)]TJT*-0.0003 Tw(servers, DNS servers, Novell NDS servers, and more.)Tj/F15 1 Tf11.5 0 0 11.5 103 217 Tm0.0119 Tc-0.0008 Tw[(COR)-51.1(BA COS Naming)]TJ/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 103 196 Tm0.0039 Tc-0.0191 Tw(The CORBA standard \(described in Chapter 11\) contains a specification for an)TjT*-0.0061 Tc-0.0133 Tw[(optional naming service in CORBA. CORBA)90(\325)25.4(s)0( naming service is called the )]TJ/F13 1 Tf31.619 0 TD(Object)Tj-31.619 -1.2381 TD0.0017 Tc-0.0556 Tw[(Naming Service)]TJ/F11 1 Tf7.1429 0 TD0.0019 Tc-0.05 Tw(, or )Tj/F13 1 Tf1.619 0 TD0.0016 Tc-0.0555 Tw[(COS Naming)]TJ/F11 1 Tf5.9048 0 TD0.0019 Tc-0.05 Tw(. COS Naming allows CORBA client programs)Tj-14.6667 -1.2381 TD0.0039 Tc0 Tw(to look up CORBA objects over a multi-tier deployment or across enterprises.)Tj0 -1.9048 TD0.0078 Tc0.0626 Tw[(T)47.4(ypically)24.3(, if you are a CORBA programmer)77.3(, you would access CORBA)111.9(\325)39.3(s)-0.1( COS)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD-0.0015 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(Naming facilities through a CORBA implementation that includes the COS Nam-)]TJT*-0.0018 Tc-0.05 Tw[(ing service. Sun Microsystem\325)-19(s)0( CORBA implementation, Java IDL, is an example)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0001 Tw(of a CORBA implementation that provides the COS Naming service.)Tj0 -1.8095 TD-0.0059 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(Sun Microsystems also provides a free service provider for JNDI that knows how)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD-0.0041 Tc-0.05 Tw[(to talk with CORBA)36.4(\325)122.7(s)0( COS Naming Service. This service provider plugs into JNDI)]TJT*0.01 Tc0.0625 Tw[(just like any other service provider)-34.3(, such as the LDAP service provider)64.3(. The)]TJETendstreamendobj1896 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F15 22 0 R/F17 29 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj1898 0 obj<</Length 4212>>stream
