ness-to-consumer model. For)Tj0 -1.2381 TD-0.0083 Tc-0.05 Tw[(instance, an online auction house such as eBay \(www)-12(.ebay)74(.com\) facilitates trans-)]TJT*0.0083 Tc0.0626 Tw[(actions between consumers by hosting auctions. This is called consumer)14.1(-to-)]TJT*-0.0133 Tc-0.05 Tw[(consumer e-commerce because goods are exchanging hands between consumers.)]TJ0 -1.8095 TD0.0039 Tc0.0013 Tw(A business may also sell goods to other businesses and take consumers out of)Tj0 -1.2381 TD0.0194 Tc0.0626 Tw[(the picture altogether. This economic model is called business-to-business)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0605 Tw[(e-commerce, and is where most of the money changes hands by far, because)]TJT*0.0105 Tw[(every business needs to conduct inter)5.6(-business transactions to survive. Manu-)]TJT*0.0017 Tc-0.05 Tw[(facturers need to buy parts from suppliers. Resellers need to buy products from)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0079 Tw[(manufacturers. And all corporations need to buy office supplies and furniture.)]TJT*0.0626 Tw[(Geographically distributed companies, conglomerates and even whole indus-)]TJT*0.0335 Tw[(tries \(such as aerospace\) rely on communication, and the ability to distribute)]TJT*0.0413 Tw(manufacturing activities gives some companies an essential economic advan-)TjT*0.0016 Tc-0.05 Tw(tage. Business-to-business e-commerce is the single largest financial impact the)TjT*-0.0004 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(Internet is making on the world economy)70.5(, and has been estimated to be 20 times)]TJT*0.0086 Tc0.0625 Tw[(as large as the other Internet economic models. As we will see, business-to-)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0001 Tw(business e-commerce is where XML has the largest impact as well.)Tj/F7 1 Tf13.5 0 0 13.5 67 113 Tm0.0002 Tc-0.0004 Tw[(Inadequacies with Existing T)75.8(e)0(chnolog)-78.1(y)]TJ/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 103 93 Tm0.0039 Tc-0.0249 Tw(The challenge for businesses to conduct affairs electronically is for businesses)TjT*-0.0046 Tc-0