 with equal power \(memory, processor power)90.5(, disk space,)]TJT*-0.0054 Tc0.0092 Tw[(and network bandwidth\))-37.5(,)-41.1( then the num)0.8(ber of concurrent users your server)53.6(-side)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0248 Tw[(deployment can support, and the number of transactions your system can ex-)]TJT*-0.0242 Tw[(ecute per second, should increase linearly. Be sure to ask your EJB server ven-)]TJT*-0.0169 Tw[(dor for case studies and customer references to back up their scalability story)14.6(.)]TJETendstreamendobj2227 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F7 8 0 R/F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F17 29 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj2229 0 obj<</Length 4106>>stream
