w[(load-balancer intelligently routes requests to other machines as needed. This)]TJT*-0.0005 Tw(maximizes your available resources.)Tj0 -1.9048 TD-0.0492 Tw[(Y)43.5(et another option is )]TJ/F13 1 Tf9.2381 0 TD-0.0547 Tw(weighted round-robin)Tj/F11 1 Tf9.8095 0 TD-0.0492 Tw(, which assigns weights to different)Tj-19.0476 -1.2381 TD-0.0154 Tw[(machines based upon their capacity)26.9(. This typically works better than an active)]TJT*0.0001 Tw[(load-sensitive balancer because it\325)8.7(s a much more lightweight implementation.)]TJ0 -1.8095 TD0.0165 Tc0.0626 Tw[(Secant and IBM are examples of vendors that provide these high-end load-)]TJ0 -1.2381 TD0.0039 Tc-0.001 Tw(balancing schemes.)TjET0.8 0.8 0.8 RG24 w /GS1 gs67 276 m97 276 lS0 0 0 RG1 w 67 264.5 m464 264.5 lSBT/F7 1 Tf15 0 0 15 73 270 Tm/GS2 gs0 Tc0.0004 Tw[(Stat)-34.7(eless T)120.7(ransparent F)27.6(ail-over)]TJ/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 103 242 Tm0.0039 Tc-0.0385 Tw[(When your application server crashes, there should be a transparent re-routing)]TJT*0.0073 Tc0.0626 Tw[(of all requests to a different application server)-14.1(. The natural place to put this)]TJT*0.0039 Tc-0.0351 Tw[(process is in intelligent client-side proxies, which intercept all network-related)]TJT*-0.0326 Tw[(problems and retry methods on alternative application servers, or in the object)]TJT*-0.0227 Tw[(request broker runtime. T)15.6(ransparent fail-over is fairly easy to implement if you)]TJT*0.0035 Tc-0.05 Tw[(restrict the client to invoke only on a stateless server)-26.9(, and assume that all trans-)]TJT*0.0039 Tc0.0003 Tw(actional resource updates can be rolled back.)TjET0.8 0.8 0.8 RG24 w /GS1 gs67 126 m97 126 lS0 0 0 RG1 w 67 114.5 m464 114.5 lSBT/F7 1 Tf15 0 0 15 73 120 Tm/GS2 gs0.0001 Tc(Clustering)Tj/F11 1 Tf10.5 0 0 10.5 103 92 Tm0.0039 Tc0.0084 Tw(A more advanced level of transparent fail-over is stateful transparent fail-over)TjT*0.0408 Tw[(or clustering. W)14.7(ith clustering, your application server is replicating conversa-)]TJT*-0.0203 Tw[(tional state across servers. If an application server crashes, another server can)]TJT*-0.0088 Tc-0.0499 Tw[(pick up the pieces since it has replicated state. If your application server supports)]TJT*-0.0061 Tc0.0088 Tw[(clustering both for W)7.9(eb components \(servlets, JSP scripts\) as well as clustering)]TJETendstreamendobj2233 0 obj<</ProcSet [/PDF /Text ]/Font <</F7 8 0 R/F11 10 0 R/F13 18 0 R/F17 29 0 R>>/ExtGState <</GS1 11 0 R/GS2 12 0 R>>/ColorSpace <</CS2 30 0 R>>>>endobj2235 0 obj<</Length 4159>>stream
